鹅绒旗袍，衣身饰有繁复的鲜艳花卉刺绣，如同瀑布般垂落至胸前，与深色面料形成了强烈的视觉对比。她的姿势充满动感且迷人；她微微前倾，双臂弯曲，双手优雅地环抱腰间，展现出纤细的手臂和精致的吊饰。她的长发被精心盘成精致的盘发，几缕柔顺的发丝自然垂落，随着光线折射，仿佛在发梢闪烁着微光。\n光线处理极具电影质感与氛围感。主要光源是柔和温暖的关键光，均匀地照亮了她的面部与天鹅绒质地的纹理；而背景光源则呈现出冷色调的漫反射，营造出一种微妙的环形光效，将人物与周围环境区分开来。背景是一幅模糊的虚化室内场景，暗示着昏暗高雅的休息室或茶室，隐约可见绿色植物与木质纹理，增强了空间的纵深感和神秘氛围。"], "inputs": [{"name": "clip", "link": 36, "label": "clip", "type": "CLIP", "localized_name": "clip"}, {"widget": {"name": "text"}, "name": "text", "label": "text", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "text"}], "flags": {}, "id": 30, "type": "CLIPTextEncode", "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "CLIPTextEncode"}, "order": 6}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [{"name": "VAE", "links": [3], "label": "VAE", "type": "VAE", "localized_name": "VAE"}], "size": [394.984375, 80], "pos": [89.79815673828125, -1158.0826416015625], "widgets_values": ["qwen_image_vae.safetensors"], "inputs": [{"widget": {"name": "vae_name"}, "name": "vae_name", "label": "vae_name", "type": "COMBO", "localized_name": "vae_name"}], "flags": {}, "id": 4, "type": "VAELoader", "properties": {"cnr_id": "comfy-core", "models": [{"name": "qwen_image_vae.safetensors", "directory": "vae", "url": "https://huggingface.co/Comfy-Org/Krea-2/resolve/main/vae/qwen_image_vae.safetensors"}], "ver": "0.25.0", "widget_ue_connectable": {"vae_name": true}, "Node name for S&R": "VAELoader"}, "order": 2}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [{"name": "CLIP", "links": [36, 38], "label": "CLIP", "type": "CLIP", "localized_name": "CLIP"}], "size": [394.734375, 140], "pos": [89.67048645019531, -1391.46826171875], "widgets_values": ["qwen3vl_4b_fp8_scaled.safetensors", "krea2", "default"], "inputs": [{"widget": {"name": "clip_name"}, "name": "clip_name", "label": "clip_name", "type": "COMBO", "localized_name": "clip_name"}, {"widget": {"name": "type"}, "name": "type", "label": "type", "type": "COMBO", "localized_name": "type"}, {"widget": {"name": "device"}, "shape": 7, "name": "device", "label": "device", "type": "COMBO", "localize